From 4471d11392de36ad8aa8c0a4bafc6e259b78ed5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiang Xincong <xincongj@codeaurora.org>
Date: Wed, 9 Nov 2016 17:24:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] add canplugin to support self-defined can frame.

canplugin funtionality
1. receiving can frame from can drivers, converting them to property
   message and transmit to sink
2. getting property message from sink, converting them to can frame and
   transmit to can driver

canplugin supported frame_type&property_type
1. support only MODE 2 in RH850 currently, which is a specific frame
   mode only used for AMB.
2. support only CES2016 demo needed properties.

TODO
1. support all properties
2. finish zone type converting function: "pzone2fzone"&"fzone2pzone"
3. receiving&sending part have no error handling mechanism, need to
   complete
4. more log need to be added
5. ADDPROPERTY should be automatically inserted

Signed-off-by: Jiang Xincong <xincongj@codeaurora.org>
